  currentLine: 0
  lines:
  - character: Player
    text: Do you know anything about Tanfana?
  - character: Villager
    text: "Not much. I\u2019ve always heard she was a spirit."
  - character: Player
    text: A spirit?
  - character: Villager
    text: "The stories say she still wanders the hills on misty nights. Some travelers
      claim they\u2019ve seen a pale woman near the Tankenberg."
  - character: Player
    text: Do you believe that?
  - character: Villager
    text: "I wouldn\u2019t go looking for her in the dark."
